---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

import '../styles/header.css';
import '../styles/footer.css';
import '../styles/our-journey.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Our Journey | ERSSOFT Limited</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Explore the ERSSOFT Limited journey from its foundation in 2021 to JD Edwards consulting and in-house business solutions."
  />
</head>

<body>

  <Header />

  <main class="journey-page">

    <section class="journey-intro">
      <span class="journey-eyebrow">ERSSOFT LIMITED</span>

      <h1>Our Journey</h1>

      <p>
        From our foundation to JD Edwards consulting and in-house solutions,
        ERSSOFT continues to develop through experience, technology and
        practical business knowledge.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="journey-timeline" aria-label="ERSSOFT journey timeline">

      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-marker">
          <span class="journey-dot"></span>
          <span class="journey-year">2021</span>
        </div>

        <div class="journey-card">
          <span class="journey-label">The Beginning</span>
          <h2>ERSSOFT Limited Founded</h2>

          <p>
            ERSSOFT Limited was established in the United Kingdom,
            built on years of experience in ERP systems, JD Edwards
            and business processes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-marker">
          <span class="journey-dot"></span>
          <span class="journey-year">2022</span>
        </div>

        <div class="journey-card">
          <span class="journey-label">A New Step</span>
          <h2>First Project</h2>

          <p>
            ERSSOFT started its first project engagement with Renaissance.
            This was an important step in bringing our ERP experience
            into the new company and beginning our project journey.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-marker">
          <span class="journey-dot"></span>
          <span class="journey-year">2023–2024</span>
        </div>

        <div class="journey-card">
          <span class="journey-label">Time to Reflect</span>
          <h2>A Period of Transition</h2>

          <p>
            These were quieter years for ERSSOFT. We used this period
            to review our direction, maintain our knowledge and think
            about how our experience could be used in future solutions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-marker">
          <span class="journey-dot"></span>
          <span class="journey-year">2025</span>
        </div>

        <div class="journey-card">
          <span class="journey-label">From Experience to Development</span>
          <h2>Building Our Own Solutions</h2>

          <p>
            ERSSOFT started developing in-house business solutions.
            Our aim was to turn practical experience from ERP,
            business processes and real working environments into
            useful software.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="journey-item">
        <div class="journey-marker">
          <span class="journey-dot"></span>
          <span class="journey-year">2026</span>
        </div>

        <div class="journey-card">
          <span class="journey-label">Moving Forward</span>
          <h2>JD Edwards &amp; In-House Solutions</h2>

          <p>
            ERSSOFT continues to focus on JD Edwards and ERP consulting
            while developing its own business applications. Our work now
            brings together ERP experience, software development, data
            and new technologies.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

    </section>

    <section class="journey-ending">
      <p>
        Our journey continues — combining experience, technology and
        practical business knowledge to build better solutions.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer />

</body>
</html>